FINAL ANSWER:
**Short answer:** ask Graham Campbell about `Lexer.php`. Ask Aiko Tanaka about the escape handling in `Escape.php`.

## `src/Parser` overall
These are surviving lines (`git blame -w -M -C`) across 10 files and 1,187 lines.

| Author | Lines | Share | Commits (share) | Last commit |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Graham Campbell (3 addresses, counted as one) | 782 | 65.9% | 33 (80.5%) | 2026-08-26 |
| Aiko Tanaka | 206 | 17.4% | 3 (7.3%) | 2026-08-26 |
| root | 117 | 9.9% | 1 (2.4%) | 2026-08-26 |
| Your Name | 69 | 5.8% | 1 (2.4%) | 2026-08-26 |
| Vance Lucas | 10 | 0.8% | 0 | 2015-10-28 |
| StyleCI Bot | 1 | 0.1% | 1 | 2026-08-26 |
| Jonas Staudenmeir | 1 | 0.1% | 1 | 2024-07-20 |
